# Bounded fields for Store and Forward archive reconciliation.

*StoreForwardSetReconciliation.radio_plan_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardSetReconciliation.scope_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true

*StoreForwardPeerBinding.primary_service_public_key max_size:32 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardPeerBinding.archive_service_public_key max_size:32

*StoreForwardCatchUpRequest.request_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpWait.request_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpReady.request_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpReady.join_token max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpJoin.request_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpJoin.join_token max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpJoinResult.request_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpReject.request_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
*StoreForwardCatchUpCancel.request_id max_size:16 fixed_length:true
